    {
      "page_id": "f03",
      "index": 3,
      "source_sha256": "bf6102ee69906dcea899df5647d4a1dc6985362cbba77f40ad5269bdb79d3754",
      "width": 3000,
      "height": 2250,
      "official_label": "pp. [2]-[3]",
      "canvas_id": "https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/canvas/2f823832-7fea-4e68-8994-8a96cf592fcb.json",
      "image_url": "https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/image/2f823832-7fea-4e68-8994-8a96cf592fcb/full/3000,/0/default.jpg",
      "layout_note": "影像與物理面對照：右p02為題頁透印及館藏章，不重錄；左p03正文。單位依固定初錄的物理面及欄序排列；實見印頁碼另列，不補版心題字。敬稱造成的明顯欄內間隔以一個U+3000表示有間隔，不重建實際寬度；行首縮排只在版面註記說明。p03：右至左欄序；明顯欄內抬頭間隔以一個U+3000表明有空白，不還原原圖實際寬度；行首縮排不另造字。",
      "layout_reviewed": true,
      "layer_states": {
        "original-print": "AI-independent-reading-and-nonblind-source-adjudication",
        "later-library-marks": "excluded-described-only"
      },
      "units": [
        {
          "id": "p03-c01",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "救主耶穌基督在世之時、周遊四方、行善",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p03-c02",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "不息、城過城、邑過邑、村過村、鄉過鄉、宣",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p03-c03",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "講福音聖道、並醫各般雜症、不拘中外",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p03-c04",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "貧富、男婦老幼、皆沾其德、不用修金謝",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p03-c05",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "價、且欲門生法其善表、乃教之曰、一要",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p03-c06",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "全心、全靈、全志、敬愛　天皇上帝、二",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p03-c07",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "要愛人如己也、茲其門人、欽遵　救主",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p03-printed-page-number",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "printed-page-number",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "一",
          "bbox": null
        }
      ],
      "uncertainties": []
    },
    {
      "page_id": "f04",
      "index": 4,
      "source_sha256": "6aaf1b563892887f8f5a971423ba9d6eec33f0740ad093fb3d4803282275e8c7",
      "width": 3000,
      "height": 2250,
      "official_label": "pp. [4]-[5]",
      "canvas_id": "https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/canvas/d222feb4-1e47-479d-9532-ec09b4c6f472.json",
      "image_url": "https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/image/d222feb4-1e47-479d-9532-ec09b4c6f472/full/3000,/0/default.jpg",
      "layout_note": "影像與物理面對照：右p04、左p05，均為正文。單位依固定初錄的物理面及欄序排列；實見印頁碼另列，不補版心題字。敬稱造成的明顯欄內間隔以一個U+3000表示有間隔，不重建實際寬度；行首縮排只在版面註記說明。p04：右至左欄序；明顯欄內抬頭間隔以一個U+3000表明有空白，不還原原圖實際寬度；行首縮排不另造字。 p05：右至左欄序；明顯欄內抬頭間隔以一個U+3000表明有空白，不還原原圖實際寬度；行首縮排不另造字。",
      "layout_reviewed": true,
      "layer_states": {
        "original-print": "AI-independent-reading-and-nonblind-source-adjudication",
        "later-library-marks": "excluded-described-only"
      },
      "units": [
        {
          "id": "p04-c01",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "之命、由西方遠境、而來中國、或傳福音",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p04-c02",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "之道、或醫染病之人、或分送聖書、以醒",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p04-c03",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "世間習俗之迷、或指引衆人、俾知獨一",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p04-c04",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "脫罪之路、此外則無別事矣、蓋普世之",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p04-c05",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "人、皆習惡俗、已獲罪於　上帝、別無脫",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p04-c06",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "罪之方、只有信從福音一路而已也、今",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p04-c07",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "計所送去之書、何下千百萬億、共算所",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p05-c01",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "醫好之人、亦不知多少千萬、卽一仁施",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p05-c02",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "醫館、已有一萬四千人、或全愈了、或醫",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p05-c03",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "幾分不等、此皆白贈、非有取絲毫於人",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p05-c04",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "也、耶穌命其門人如此、則其愛人之心、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p05-c05",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "不可見歟、且爾衆人、不拘貴賤賢愚、豈",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p05-c06",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "不盡稱耶穌爲憐憫之神、慈善之救主",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p05-c07",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "哉、是故萬當敬愛、而獨奉事之矣、且其",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p05-printed-page-number",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "printed-page-number",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "二",
          "bbox": null
        }
      ],
      "uncertainties": []
    },
    {
      "page_id": "f05",
      "index": 5,
      "source_sha256": "1fef55249bff9e2375f854475925772e58ad143700fbbd76cb47133d8b7fc22e",
      "width": 3000,
      "height": 2250,
      "official_label": "pp. [6]-[7]",
      "canvas_id": "https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/canvas/f63f55fe-560b-44e8-b4d4-4f0f235435cf.json",
      "image_url": "https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/image/f63f55fe-560b-44e8-b4d4-4f0f235435cf/full/3000,/0/default.jpg",
      "layout_note": "影像與物理面對照：右p06、左p07，均為正文。單位依固定初錄的物理面及欄序排列；實見印頁碼另列，不補版心題字。敬稱造成的明顯欄內間隔以一個U+3000表示有間隔，不重建實際寬度；行首縮排只在版面註記說明。p06：右至左欄序；明顯欄內抬頭間隔以一個U+3000表明有空白，不還原原圖實際寬度；行首縮排不另造字。 p07：右至左欄序；明顯欄內抬頭間隔以一個U+3000表明有空白，不還原原圖實際寬度；行首縮排不另造字。",
      "layout_reviewed": true,
      "layer_states": {
        "original-print": "AI-independent-reading-and-nonblind-source-adjudication",
        "later-library-marks": "excluded-described-only"
      },
      "units": [
        {
          "id": "p06-c01",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "門人、不遠千里而來、旣無名利之望、又",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p06-c02",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "無德報之求、則其所傳之道必眞、而其",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p06-c03",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "所行之事、只欲衆人之益、又　諸君之",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p06-c04",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "所當信諒者矣、倘衆位經見我等之所",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p06-c05",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "爲、而知我等之善意、則於下文之言、信",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p06-c06",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "而記之、是所厚望焉、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p06-c07",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "每見跛盲等輩、來自遠方、久染痼疾、遂",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p07-c01",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "成不治之症、倘其早來、則未嘗有不能",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p07-c02",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "治者也、我等旣不索人謝金藥價、乃欲",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p07-c03",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "行善於衆、故不騙人、觀其症不可治、則",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p07-c04",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "直言不諱、令之回家、然知其症、若是早",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p07-c05",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "來、定然可醫、特因遲延悞之耳、則又不",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p07-c06",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "能不爲之痛恨也、尤可痛者、伊見別人、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p07-c07",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "多得醫痊、而自己之症不治、遂謂我等",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p07-printed-page-number",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "printed-page-number",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "三",
          "bbox": null
        }
      ],
      "uncertainties": []
    },
    {
      "page_id": "f06",
      "index": 6,
      "source_sha256": "da210b83951f19ecd1f01d63198aa374b41d1533e086b9f302c4703473502aeb",
      "width": 3000,
      "height": 2250,
      "official_label": "pp. [8]-[9]",
      "canvas_id": "https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/canvas/b0d48395-e74e-4ee8-afcd-0452769796b7.json",
      "image_url": "https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/image/b0d48395-e74e-4ee8-afcd-0452769796b7/full/3000,/0/default.jpg",
      "layout_note": "影像與物理面對照：右p08、左p09，均為正文。單位依固定初錄的物理面及欄序排列；實見印頁碼另列，不補版心題字。敬稱造成的明顯欄內間隔以一個U+3000表示有間隔，不重建實際寬度；行首縮排只在版面註記說明。p08：右至左欄序；明顯欄內抬頭間隔以一個U+3000表明有空白，不還原原圖實際寬度；行首縮排不另造字。 p09：右至左欄序；明顯欄內抬頭間隔以一個U+3000表明有空白，不還原原圖實際寬度；行首縮排不另造字。",
      "layout_reviewed": true,
      "layer_states": {
        "original-print": "AI-independent-reading-and-nonblind-source-adjudication",
        "later-library-marks": "excluded-described-only"
      },
      "units": [
        {
          "id": "p08-c01",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "不肯醫之、有時我心不忍、姑留而試之、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p08-c02",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "或可醫其一二分、亦是美事、及至用盡",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p08-c03",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "方法、而終不能有益於事也、是故奉勸",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p08-c04",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "諸君、不幸而有疾者、趂病尙淺、可卽來",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p08-c05",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "館調治、不可吝惜路途之小費、而失却",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p08-c06",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "本身之大益、蓋因早來、病可速愈、若時",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p08-c07",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "越久、則症越深、便有難治之患矣、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p09-c01",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "再者、每見病人、未來之先、今日一個先",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p09-c02",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "生、明日一個先生、費盡錢銀、屢藥不効、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p09-c03",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "然後方來醫館、請問衆位、何爲虛費此",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p09-c04",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "錢銀耶、卽使富者、亦不須虛費、況爾貧",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p09-c05",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "者、衣食尙且難贍、何有餘錢而虛費耶、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p09-c06",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "會記館中醫好之人、有些自說、未來醫",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p09-c07",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "館之先、因請先生調治、衣衫典當不足、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p09-printed-page-number",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "printed-page-number",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "四",
          "bbox": null
        }
      ],
      "uncertainties": []
    },
    {
      "page_id": "f07",
      "index": 7,
      "source_sha256": "b24f56ea7931e61063e4b3aff9f35547b1fe429f49c130c6e16d39c0b7d96749",
      "width": 3000,
      "height": 2250,
      "official_label": "pp. [10]-[11]",
      "canvas_id": "https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/canvas/bb2dee93-8ad0-43fa-903c-8e8ed1ed4618.json",
      "image_url": "https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/image/bb2dee93-8ad0-43fa-903c-8e8ed1ed4618/full/3000,/0/default.jpg",
      "layout_note": "影像與物理面對照：右p10、左p11，均為正文。單位依固定初錄的物理面及欄序排列；實見印頁碼另列，不補版心題字。敬稱造成的明顯欄內間隔以一個U+3000表示有間隔，不重建實際寬度；行首縮排只在版面註記說明。p10：右至左欄序；明顯欄內抬頭間隔以一個U+3000表明有空白，不還原原圖實際寬度；行首縮排不另造字。 p11：右至左欄序；明顯欄內抬頭間隔以一個U+3000表明有空白，不還原原圖實際寬度；行首縮排不另造字。",
      "layout_reviewed": true,
      "layer_states": {
        "original-print": "AI-independent-reading-and-nonblind-source-adjudication",
        "later-library-marks": "excluded-described-only"
      },
      "units": [
        {
          "id": "p10-c01",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "而又借貸於人者多矣、然病終不能愈",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p10-c02",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "也、噫、何一愚至此哉、請以譬喻言之、今",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p10-c03",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "有二人於此、一爲賣米者、一爲送米者、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p10-c04",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "君欲得米、將往誰先、雖黃口小童、亦知",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p10-c05",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "答云、先往送米者也、　諸君盍不照是",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p10-c06",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "而行、先來本館、不須謝金藥價者、而求",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p10-c07",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "醫乎、若嘗過所送之米不佳、不足以養",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p11-c01",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "生、無怪寕用錢以買於賣米者、　諸君",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p11-c02",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "亦然、先來本館、倘不能醫、然後寕費錢",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p11-c03",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "以求別醫、也未爲遲、誠如是、則不致久",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p11-c04",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "延症難、又不爲庸醫所悞、而吾敢告",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p11-c05",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "諸君、卽一萬四千醫好之人、亦可傳告、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p11-c06",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "本館遍醫百病、鮮有不能治者、此非虛",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p11-c07",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "張聲勢、如庸醫者所爲、以騙人財物、我",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "p11-printed-page-number",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "printed-page-number",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "五",
          "bbox": null
        }
      ],
